      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "He is quite big, white with pink -coloured wing tips. He doesn\u2019t
          like loud noises and his name is Pirate. He likes shining things and cookies."
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: es
        value: Es bastante grande, blanco con las puntas de las alas de color rosa.
          No le gustan los ruidos fuertes y se llama Pirata. Le gustan las cosas
          brillantes y las galletas.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: "Er ist ziemlich gro\xDF, wei\xDF mit rosa Fl\xFCgelspitzen. Er mag
          keine lauten Ger\xE4usche und sein Name ist Pirat. Er mag gl\xE4nzende
          Dinge und Kekse"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: "\xC8 piuttosto grande, bianco con le punte delle ali color rosa .
          Non ama i rumori forti e il suo nome \xE8 Pirata. Gli piacciono le cose
          che brillano e biscotti."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
